{"slug":"anchorbrowser","name":"Anchor Browser","description":"Anchor Browser provides secure, scalable cloud-based Chromium environments for AI/computer-use agents to automate any web task. It delivers human-like, authenticated browsing with OmniConnect authentication, built-in enterprise VPN, Cloudflare Web-Bot-Auth verification, and a stealth Chromium fork. Anchor emphasizes deterministic, reliable workflows with SDK and MCP integrations, enabling teams to deploy millions of browser agents in parallel for production-grade automation.","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/stuff.thingsofbrand.com/anchorbrowser.io/images/img9_anchorbrowser.png","domain":"anchorbrowser.io","rank":245,"labels":["AI Tools","Developer Tools","IT Operations"],"categories":["ai-tools","developer-tools"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"Perform Web Task","d":"Launch a secure cloud Chromium session and execute automated browsing instructions.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Check Task Generation Status","d":"Retrieve the generation status of a browser automation task.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get Task Run Status","d":"Get the current status and result of a task run.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Start Browser Session","d":"Retrieve the current generation status of a browser automation task.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"End All Browser Sessions","d":"End all browser sessions to stop running automations and free their resources.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Browser Profile","d":"Create a browser profile with a name and optional description, and link it to a session or a dedicated sticky IP.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Move Mouse Pointer","d":"Move the mouse pointer to specified x/y coordinates in an active browser session.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Set Clipboard Text","d":"Set the clipboard text for an active browser session.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get Clipboard Text","d":"Get the clipboard text from an active browser session.","t":"action","k":"hoo